			"description": "<ul><li><p>A slowed creature's Speed is halved.</p></li><li><p>A slowed creature takes a −2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saving throws.</p></li><li><p>A slowed creature cannot take reactions.</p></li><li><p>On its turn, a slowed creature can take either an action or a bonus action, not both. In addition, it can't make more than one melee or ranged attack during its turn.</p></li></ul>",
